-dwellings claim) [SUPPORTED: https://heritagemalta.mt/explore/borg-in-nadur/]; The site includes a Bronze Age village [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bor%C4%A1_in-Nadur]; The Bronze Age village had a D-shaped bastion [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bor%C4%A1_in-Nadur]; Sherds of Mycenaean origin were found at the site [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bor%C4%A1_in-Nadur]; The Mycenaean sherds hint at contact between Malta and the Aegean [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bor%C4%A1_in-Nadur]"}]'::jsonb),
