i/Aquae_Arnemetiae]; The town had a temple, whose base was documented overlooking the baths and springs [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aquae_Arnemetiae]; The temple was dedicated to Arnemetia, a water deity [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aquae_Arnemetiae]"}]'::jsonb),
