ia.org/wiki/Glastonbury_Lake_Village]; The houses were covered with reeds [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Glastonbury_Lake_Village]; The peat preserved wheel spokes at the site [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Glastonbury_Lake_Village]; The peat preserved an unfinished wheel hub (nave) at the site [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Glastonbury_Lake_Village]"}]'::jsonb),
