_of_Pedra_Branca]; The dolmen held many offerings [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dolmen_of_Pedra_Branca]; The chamber roof was supported in the middle by a 2.2 meter tall quartzite pillar [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dolmen_of_Pedra_Branca]"}]'::jsonb),
